# Fake News Detection

## Overview
This project detects fake news articles using Logistic Regression. It processes text data from news articles and predicts whether the news is real or fake.

## Dataset
The dataset contains:
- Text: news article content or headline
- Label: 1 for fake, 0 for real

## Methodology
1. Text preprocessing:
   - Tokenization
   - Stopword removal
   - Lemmatization
2. Feature extraction using TF-IDF
3. Model: Logistic Regression
4. Evaluation using accuracy, precision, recall, F1-score, and confusion matrix

